## 1. Sqrt(x) – LeetCode #69

**Difficulty:** Easy

**Concept:** Use Binary Search to find the integer square root without using `Math.sqrt()`.

**Time Complexity:** O(log x)  
**Space Complexity:** O(1)

```java
class Solution {
    public int mySqrt(int x) {
        int left = 0;
        int right = x;
        int answer = 0;

        while (left <= right) {
            int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;

            if (mid == 0 || mid <= x / mid) {
                answer = mid;
                left = mid + 1;
            } else {
                right = mid - 1;
            }
        }

        return answer;
    }
}
```

