## 3. Find Minimum in Rotated Sorted Array – LeetCode #153

**Difficulty:** Medium

**Concept:** Compare the middle element with the rightmost element to find which half contains the minimum.

**Time Complexity:** O(log n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(1)

```java
class Solution {
    public int findMin(int[] nums) {
        int left = 0;
        int right = nums.length - 1;

        while (left < right) {
            int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;

            if (nums[mid] > nums[right]) {
                left = mid + 1;
            } else {
                right = mid;
            }
        }

        return nums[left];
    }
}
```

[LeetCode Problem](https://leetcode.com/problems/find-minimum-in-rotated-sorted-array/)

