## 5. Sort Colors – LeetCode #75

**Difficulty:** Medium

**Concept:** Use the Dutch National Flag algorithm with three pointers to sort 0s, 1s, and 2s.

**Time Complexity:** O(n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(1)

```java
class Solution {
    public void sortColors(int[] nums) {
        int low = 0;
        int mid = 0;
        int high = nums.length - 1;

        while (mid <= high) {
            if (nums[mid] == 0) {
                int temp = nums[low];
                nums[low] = nums[mid];
                nums[mid] = temp;

                low++;
                mid++;
            } else if (nums[mid] == 1) {
                mid++;
            } else {
                int temp = nums[mid];
                nums[mid] = nums[high];
                nums[high] = temp;

                high--;
            }
        }
    }
}
```

